flowchart TD
    start([User starts existing cleanup scan]) --> roots[[Known roots including two developer roots]]
    roots --> local{No cloud or linked root?}
    local -->|No| skip([Exclude linked developer root; no candidate])
    local -->|Yes| measure[[Bounded metadata walk with age checks]]
    measure --> complete{Complete candidate and old descendants?}
    complete -->|No| partial([Exclude incomplete candidate; report partial])
    complete -->|Yes| review([Review-only candidate in existing report])
    review --> consent{Existing exact local trash approval?}
    consent -->|No| unchanged([No deletion])
    consent -->|Yes| trash[[Existing revalidation and trash journal]]
